{"schemaVersion":2,"bookId":"mackay-information-theory-2003","title":"附录 A　记号","sourcePdfPages":[610,612],"toc":[{"number":"A","title":"记号","block":"p610-b001"}],"blocks":[{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"heading","level":1,"text":"附录 A　记号","segments":["附录 A　记号"],"id":"p610-b001","html":"<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"display:block;border-bottom:3px solid currentColor;padding-bottom:.45em;margin-bottom:.45em\">附录 A</span><span style=\"display:block;font-style:italic;white-space:nowrap\">记号</span></h1>"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"intro","text":"编者导读　本附录汇集本书常用的概率、微积分和矩阵记号，并说明一些符号在不同语境下的含义。遇到不熟悉的记号时，可以按条目查阅。","segments":[{"strong":true,"text":"编者导读"},"　本附录汇集本书常用的概率、微积分和矩阵记号，并说明一些符号在不同语境下的含义。遇到不熟悉的记号时，可以按条目查阅。"],"id":"p610-b002"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$P(A\\mid B,C)$ 表示什么？ $P(A\\mid B,C)$ 读作“在已知 $B$ 为真且 $C$ 为真的条件下，$A$ 为真的概率”；简言之，即“给定 $B$ 和 $C$ 时 $A$ 的概率”。（见第 2 章，印刷页 22。）","segments":[{"tex":"P(A\\mid B,C)","text":"P(A\\mid B,C)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," ",{"tex":"P(A\\mid B,C)","text":"P(A\\mid B,C)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 读作“",{"em":true,"text":"在已知"}," ",{"tex":"B","text":"B","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></math>"}," 为真且 ",{"tex":"C","text":"C","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></math>"}," 为真的条件下，",{"tex":"A","text":"A","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></math>"}," 为真的概率”；简言之，即“给定 ",{"tex":"B","text":"B","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"C","text":"C","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></math>"}," 时 ",{"tex":"A","text":"A","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的概率”。（见第 2 章，印刷页 22。）"],"id":"p610-b003"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\log$ 和 $\\ln$ 表示什么？ 在本书中，$\\log x$ 表示以 2 为底的对数，即 $\\log_2 x$；$\\ln x$ 表示自然对数，即 $\\log_e x$。","segments":[{"tex":"\\log","text":"\\log","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 和 "},{"tex":"\\ln","text":"\\ln","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 在本书中，",{"tex":"\\log x","text":"\\log x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示以 2 为底的对数，即 ",{"tex":"\\log_2 x","text":"\\log_2 x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"},"；",{"tex":"\\ln x","text":"\\ln x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示自然对数，即 ",{"tex":"\\log_e x","text":"\\log_e x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p610-b004"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\hat s$ 表示什么？ 通常，变量上方的“帽子”表示猜测值或估计量。因此，$\\hat s$ 是对 $s$ 的取值所作的猜测。","segments":[{"tex":"\\hat s","text":"\\hat s","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 通常，变量上方的“帽子”表示猜测值或估计量。因此，",{"tex":"\\hat s","text":"\\hat s","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></math>"}," 是对 ",{"tex":"s","text":"s","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的取值所作的猜测。"],"id":"p610-b005"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"积分。 $\\int f(u)\\,\\mathrm du$ 与 $\\int \\mathrm du\\,f(u)$ 没有区别；两种写法的被积函数都是 $f(u)$。","segments":[{"strong":true,"text":"积分。"}," ",{"tex":"\\int f(u)\\,\\mathrm du","text":"\\int f(u)\\,\\mathrm du","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></math>"}," 与 ",{"tex":"\\int \\mathrm du\\,f(u)","text":"\\int \\mathrm du\\,f(u)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 没有区别；两种写法的被积函数都是 ",{"tex":"f(u)","text":"f(u)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p610-b006"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\prod_{n=1}^{N}$ 表示什么？ 它与求和记号 $\\sum_{n=1}^{N}$ 类似，不过表示连乘。可读作“从 1 到 $N$，对 $n$ 连乘”。例如，","segments":[{"tex":"\\prod_{n=1}^{N}","text":"\\prod_{n=1}^{N}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 它与求和记号 ",{"tex":"\\sum_{n=1}^{N}","text":"\\sum_{n=1}^{N}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow></math>"}," 类似，不过表示连乘。可读作“从 1 到 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"},"，对 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"}," 连乘”。例如，"],"id":"p610-b007"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\prod_{n=1}^{N}n=1\\times2\\times3\\times\\cdots\\times N=N!=\\exp\\left[\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\ln n\\right].","number":"(A.1)","text":"$$\\prod_{n=1}^{N}n=1\\times2\\times3\\times\\cdots\\times N=N!=\\exp\\left[\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\ln n\\right].\\tag{A.1}$$","id":"p610-b008","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"对求和或连乘中的自由变量，我喜欢选用范围上限字母的小写形式，这里的例子是 $n$。因此，$n$ 通常从 1 取到 $N$，$m$ 通常从 1 取到 $M$。这个习惯是我从 Yaser Abu-Mostafa 那里学来的；我认为它让公式更容易理解。","segments":["对求和或连乘中的自由变量，我喜欢选用范围上限字母的小写形式，这里的例子是 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"},"。因此，",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"}," 通常从 1 取到 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"},"，",{"tex":"m","text":"m","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></math>"}," 通常从 1 取到 ",{"tex":"M","text":"M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></math>"},"。这个习惯是我从 Yaser Abu-Mostafa 那里学来的；我认为它让公式更容易理解。"],"id":"p610-b009"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\binom{N}{n}$ 表示什么？ 这个记号读作“$N$ 选 $n$”，表示从一个含有 $N$ 个对象的集合中选出 $n$ 个对象、不计顺序时的选法数。","segments":[{"tex":"\\binom{N}{n}","text":"\\binom{N}{n}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>N</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 这个记号读作“",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"}," 选 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"},"”，表示从一个含有 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个对象的集合中选出 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个对象、不计顺序时的选法数。"],"id":"p610-b010"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\binom{N}{n}=\\frac{N!}{(N-n)!\\,n!}.","number":"(A.2)","text":"$$\\binom{N}{n}=\\frac{N!}{(N-n)!\\,n!}.\\tag{A.2}$$","id":"p610-b011","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>N</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"这个函数称为组合函数（combination function）。","segments":["这个函数称为组合函数（combination function）。"],"id":"p610-b012"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\Gamma(x)$ 是什么？ 伽马函数（gamma function）定义为 $\\Gamma(x)\\equiv\\int_0^\\infty\\mathrm du\\,u^{x-1}e^{-u}$，其中 $x>0$。伽马函数把阶乘函数扩展到实数自变量。一般有 $\\Gamma(x+1)=x\\Gamma(x)$；对于整数自变量，$\\Gamma(x+1)=x!$。双伽马函数（digamma function）定义为 $\\Psi(x)\\equiv\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dx}\\ln\\Gamma(x)$。","segments":[{"tex":"\\Gamma(x)","text":"\\Gamma(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 是什么？"}," ",{"em":true,"text":"伽马函数"},"（gamma function）定义为 ",{"tex":"\\Gamma(x)\\equiv\\int_0^\\infty\\mathrm du\\,u^{x-1}e^{-u}","text":"\\Gamma(x)\\equiv\\int_0^\\infty\\mathrm du\\,u^{x-1}e^{-u}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></math>"},"，其中 ",{"tex":"x>0","text":"x>0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。伽马函数把阶乘函数扩展到实数自变量。一般有 ",{"tex":"\\Gamma(x+1)=x\\Gamma(x)","text":"\\Gamma(x+1)=x\\Gamma(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"；对于整数自变量，",{"tex":"\\Gamma(x+1)=x!","text":"\\Gamma(x+1)=x!","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></math>"},"。",{"em":true,"text":"双伽马函数"},"（digamma function）定义为 ",{"tex":"\\Psi(x)\\equiv\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dx}\\ln\\Gamma(x)","text":"\\Psi(x)\\equiv\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dx}\\ln\\Gamma(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p610-b013"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"当 $x$ 较大时（实际使用中，$0.1\\leq x\\leq\\infty$），","segments":["当 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 较大时（实际使用中，",{"tex":"0.1\\leq x\\leq\\infty","text":"0.1\\leq x\\leq\\infty","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></math>"},"），"],"id":"p610-b014"},{"pdfPage":610,"page":1,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\ln\\Gamma(x)\\simeq\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)\\ln(x)-x+\\frac12\\ln 2\\pi+O(1/x);","number":"(A.3)","text":"$$\\ln\\Gamma(x)\\simeq\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)\\ln(x)-x+\\frac12\\ln 2\\pi+O(1/x);\\tag{A.3}$$","id":"p610-b015","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≃</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"而当 $x$ 较小时（实际使用中，$0\\leq x\\leq0.5$）：","segments":["而当 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 较小时（实际使用中，",{"tex":"0\\leq x\\leq0.5","text":"0\\leq x\\leq0.5","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></math>"},"）："],"id":"p611-b001"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\ln\\Gamma(x)\\simeq\\ln\\frac1x-\\gamma_e x+O(x^2)","number":"(A.4)","text":"$$\\ln\\Gamma(x)\\simeq\\ln\\frac1x-\\gamma_e x+O(x^2)\\tag{A.4}$$","id":"p611-b002","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≃</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"其中 $\\gamma_e$ 是欧拉常数。","segments":["其中 ",{"tex":"\\gamma_e","text":"\\gamma_e","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></math>"}," 是欧拉常数。"],"id":"p611-b003"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$H_2^{-1}(1-R/C)$ 表示什么？ 正如 $\\sin^{-1}(s)$ 表示函数 $s=\\sin(x)$ 的反函数，$H_2^{-1}(h)$ 表示函数 $h=H_2(x)$ 的反函数。","segments":[{"tex":"H_2^{-1}(1-R/C)","text":"H_2^{-1}(1-R/C)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 正如 ",{"tex":"\\sin^{-1}(s)","text":"\\sin^{-1}(s)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示函数 ",{"tex":"s=\\sin(x)","text":"s=\\sin(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的反函数，",{"tex":"H_2^{-1}(h)","text":"H_2^{-1}(h)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示函数 ",{"tex":"h=H_2(x)","text":"h=H_2(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的反函数。"],"id":"p611-b004"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"有人用 $\\sin^2x$ 表示 $(\\sin x)^2$，这可能造成混淆：按这种写法，我们或许会以为 $\\sin^{-1}s$ 表示 $1/\\sin(s)$。因此，我倾向于避免使用 $\\sin^2x$ 这种记号。","segments":["有人用 ",{"tex":"\\sin^2x","text":"\\sin^2x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示 ",{"tex":"(\\sin x)^2","text":"(\\sin x)^2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>"},"，这可能造成混淆：按这种写法，我们或许会以为 ",{"tex":"\\sin^{-1}s","text":"\\sin^{-1}s","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>s</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示 ",{"tex":"1/\\sin(s)","text":"1/\\sin(s)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。因此，我倾向于避免使用 ",{"tex":"\\sin^2x","text":"\\sin^2x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 这种记号。"],"id":"p611-b005"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$f'(x)$ 表示什么？ 这取决于语境。撇号常用来表示求导：","segments":[{"tex":"f'(x)","text":"f'(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 这取决于语境。撇号常用来表示求导："],"id":"p611-b006"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"formula","tex":"f'(x)\\equiv\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dx}f(x);","number":"(A.5)","text":"$$f'(x)\\equiv\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dx}f(x);\\tag{A.5}$$","id":"p611-b007","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"类似地，变量上方的点表示对时间 $t$ 求导：","segments":["类似地，变量上方的点表示对时间 ",{"tex":"t","text":"t","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></math>"}," 求导："],"id":"p611-b008"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\dot x\\equiv\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}x.","number":"(A.6)","text":"$$\\dot x\\equiv\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}x.\\tag{A.6}$$","id":"p611-b009","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>≡</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"不过，撇号也可用于标记“另一个变量”，例如“同一变量的新取值”。所以，$x'$ 可以表示“$x$ 的新取值”。如果有两个整数都从 1 取到 $N$，我也常把它们记为 $n$ 和 $n'$。","segments":["不过，撇号也可用于标记“另一个变量”，例如“同一变量的新取值”。所以，",{"tex":"x'","text":"x'","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow></math>"}," 可以表示“",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的新取值”。如果有两个整数都从 1 取到 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"},"，我也常把它们记为 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"n'","text":"n'","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p611-b010"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"因此，我采用的规则是：撇号出现在可能表示函数的表达式中时，例如 $f'(x)$ 或 $h'(y)$，它表示求导；在其他情况下，它表示“另一个变量”。","segments":["因此，我采用的规则是：撇号出现在可能表示函数的表达式中时，例如 ",{"tex":"f'(x)","text":"f'(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 或 ",{"tex":"h'(y)","text":"h'(y)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"，它表示求导；在其他情况下，它表示“另一个变量”。"],"id":"p611-b011"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"误差函数是什么？ 这个函数有不同的定义。我把它定义为标准正态分布（方差为 1）的累积概率：","segments":[{"strong":true,"text":"误差函数是什么？"}," 这个函数有不同的定义。我把它定义为标准正态分布（方差为 1）的累积概率："],"id":"p611-b012"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\Phi(z)\\equiv\\int_{-\\infty}^{z}\\frac{\\exp(-z^2/2)}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\,\\mathrm dz.","number":"(A.7)","text":"$$\\Phi(z)\\equiv\\int_{-\\infty}^{z}\\frac{\\exp(-z^2/2)}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\,\\mathrm dz.\\tag{A.7}$$","id":"p611-b013","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\mathcal E(r)$ 表示什么？ $\\mathcal E[r]$ 读作“$r$ 的期望值”或“$r$ 的期望”，即 $r$ 的平均值。“期望值”也可以用一对尖括号表示：$\\langle r\\rangle$。","segments":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E(r)","text":"\\mathcal E(r)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," ",{"tex":"\\mathcal E[r]","text":"\\mathcal E[r]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"}," 读作“",{"tex":"r","text":"r","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的期望值”或“",{"tex":"r","text":"r","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的期望”，即 ",{"tex":"r","text":"r","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的平均值。“期望值”也可以用一对尖括号表示：",{"tex":"\\langle r\\rangle","text":"\\langle r\\rangle","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p611-b014"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$|x|$ 表示什么？ 两条竖线 $|\\cdot|$ 有两种含义。如果 $A$ 是集合，$|A|$ 表示这个集合的元素个数；如果 $x$ 是数，$|x|$ 表示 $x$ 的绝对值。","segments":[{"tex":"|x|","text":"|x|","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 两条竖线 ",{"tex":"|\\cdot|","text":"|\\cdot|","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></math>"}," 有两种含义。如果 ",{"tex":"A","text":"A","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></math>"}," 是集合，",{"tex":"|A|","text":"|A|","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示这个集合的元素个数；如果 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 是数，",{"tex":"|x|","text":"|x|","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的绝对值。"],"id":"p611-b015"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$[\\mathbf A|\\mathbf P]$ 表示什么？ 这里的 $\\mathbf A$ 和 $\\mathbf P$ 是行数相同的矩阵。$[\\mathbf A|\\mathbf P]$ 表示把 $\\mathbf A$ 与 $\\mathbf P$ 并排拼接成的矩阵，其宽度为原来的两倍。竖线用于避免与矩阵乘积 $\\mathbf A\\mathbf P$ 混淆。","segments":[{"tex":"[\\mathbf A|\\mathbf P]","text":"[\\mathbf A|\\mathbf P]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 这里的 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf A","text":"\\mathbf A","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf P","text":"\\mathbf P","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi></mrow></math>"}," 是行数相同的矩阵。",{"tex":"[\\mathbf A|\\mathbf P]","text":"[\\mathbf A|\\mathbf P]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示把 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf A","text":"\\mathbf A","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow></math>"}," 与 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf P","text":"\\mathbf P","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi></mrow></math>"}," 并排拼接成的矩阵，其宽度为原来的两倍。竖线用于避免与矩阵乘积 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\mathbf P","text":"\\mathbf A\\mathbf P","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi></mrow></math>"}," 混淆。"],"id":"p611-b016"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\mathbf x^{\\mathrm T}$ 表示什么？ 上标 $\\mathrm T$ 读作“转置”。行向量转置后成为列向量：","segments":[{"tex":"\\mathbf x^{\\mathrm T}","text":"\\mathbf x^{\\mathrm T}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 上标 ",{"tex":"\\mathrm T","text":"\\mathrm T","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></math>"}," 读作“转置”。行向量转置后成为列向量："],"id":"p611-b017"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"formula","tex":"(1,2,3)^{\\mathrm T}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix},","number":"(A.8)","text":"$$(1,2,3)^{\\mathrm T}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix},\\tag{A.8}$$","id":"p611-b018","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"反过来也一样。［通常，我用黑体字母表示的向量（$\\mathbf x$）是列向量。］","segments":[{"em":true,"text":"反过来也一样"},"。［通常，我用黑体字母表示的向量（",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"},"）是列向量。］"],"id":"p611-b019"},{"pdfPage":611,"page":2,"kind":"paragraph","text":"矩阵同样可以转置。如果 $M_{ij}$ 是矩阵 $\\mathbf M$ 第 $i$ 行、第 $j$ 列的元素，且 $\\mathbf N=\\mathbf M^{\\mathrm T}$，那么 $N_{ji}=M_{ij}$。","segments":["矩阵同样可以转置。如果 ",{"tex":"M_{ij}","text":"M_{ij}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></math>"}," 是矩阵 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf M","text":"\\mathbf M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi></mrow></math>"}," 第 ",{"tex":"i","text":"i","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></math>"}," 行、第 ",{"tex":"j","text":"j","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow></math>"}," 列的元素，且 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf N=\\mathbf M^{\\mathrm T}","text":"\\mathbf N=\\mathbf M^{\\mathrm T}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup></mrow></math>"},"，那么 ",{"tex":"N_{ji}=M_{ij}","text":"N_{ji}=M_{ij}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p611-b020"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\mathrm{Trace}\\,\\mathbf M$ 和 $\\det\\mathbf M$ 是什么？ 矩阵的迹是它的对角元素之和：","segments":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trace}\\,\\mathbf M","text":"\\mathrm{Trace}\\,\\mathbf M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 和 "},{"tex":"\\det\\mathbf M","text":"\\det\\mathbf M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 是什么？"}," 矩阵的迹是它的对角元素之和："],"id":"p612-b001"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\mathrm{Trace}\\,\\mathbf M=\\sum_i M_{ii}.","number":"(A.9)","text":"$$\\mathrm{Trace}\\,\\mathbf M=\\sum_i M_{ii}.\\tag{A.9}$$","id":"p612-b002","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"矩阵 $\\mathbf M$ 的行列式记为 $\\det\\mathbf M$。","segments":["矩阵 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf M","text":"\\mathbf M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的行列式记为 ",{"tex":"\\det\\mathbf M","text":"\\det\\mathbf M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p612-b003"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\delta_{mn}$ 表示什么？ $\\delta$ 矩阵是单位矩阵。","segments":[{"tex":"\\delta_{mn}","text":"\\delta_{mn}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," ",{"tex":"\\delta","text":"\\delta","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 矩阵是单位矩阵。"],"id":"p612-b004"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\delta_{mn}=\\begin{cases}1&\\text{当 }m=n\\\\0&\\text{当 }m\\ne n.\\end{cases}","number":"","text":"$$\\delta_{mn}=\\begin{cases}1&\\text{当 }m=n\\\\0&\\text{当 }m\\ne n.\\end{cases}$$","id":"p612-b005","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>当 </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>当 </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"单位矩阵也记作 $\\mathbf I$ 或 $\\mathbf 1$。有时，我会在这个符号上加下标，例如 $\\mathbf 1_K$，以表示矩阵的大小为 $K\\times K$。","segments":["单位矩阵也记作 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf I","text":"\\mathbf I","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi></mrow></math>"}," 或 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf 1","text":"\\mathbf 1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn></mrow></math>"},"。有时，我会在这个符号上加下标，例如 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf 1_K","text":"\\mathbf 1_K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow></math>"},"，以表示矩阵的大小为 ",{"tex":"K\\times K","text":"K\\times K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p612-b006"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\delta(x)$ 表示什么？ 德尔塔函数（delta function）具有以下性质：","segments":[{"tex":"\\delta(x)","text":"\\delta(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," 德尔塔函数（delta function）具有以下性质："],"id":"p612-b007"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\int\\mathrm dx\\,f(x)\\delta(x)=f(0).","number":"(A.10)","text":"$$\\int\\mathrm dx\\,f(x)\\delta(x)=f(0).\\tag{A.10}$$","id":"p612-b008","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\delta(S)$ 也可能用来表示真值函数：当命题 $S$ 为真时，它取值为 1；不过，我为真值函数采用了另一种记法。毕竟，符号 $\\delta$ 已经相当忙碌了：除了上述两种用途，它还表示一个较小的实数 $\\delta$，也用作增量算子，例如 $\\delta x$！","segments":[{"tex":"\\delta(S)","text":"\\delta(S)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 也可能用来表示真值函数：当命题 ",{"tex":"S","text":"S","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></math>"}," 为真时，它取值为 1；不过，我为真值函数采用了另一种记法。毕竟，符号 ",{"tex":"\\delta","text":"\\delta","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 已经相当忙碌了：除了上述两种用途，它还表示一个较小的实数 ",{"tex":"\\delta","text":"\\delta","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow></math>"},"，也用作增量算子，例如 ",{"tex":"\\delta x","text":"\\delta x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"},"！"],"id":"p612-b009"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$\\mathbb{1}[S]$ 表示什么？ $\\mathbb{1}[S]$ 是真值函数：命题 $S$ 为真时取 1，否则取 0。例如，集合 $T=\\{-2,1,3\\}$ 中正数的个数可以写成","segments":[{"tex":"\\mathbb{1}[S]","text":"\\mathbb{1}[S]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":" 表示什么？"}," ",{"tex":"\\mathbb{1}[S]","text":"\\mathbb{1}[S]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"}," 是真值函数：命题 ",{"tex":"S","text":"S","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></math>"}," 为真时取 1，否则取 0。例如，集合 ",{"tex":"T=\\{-2,1,3\\}","text":"T=\\{-2,1,3\\}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></math>"}," 中正数的个数可以写成"],"id":"p612-b010"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\sum_{x\\in T}\\mathbb{1}[x>0].","number":"(A.11)","text":"$$\\sum_{x\\in T}\\mathbb{1}[x>0].\\tag{A.11}$$","id":"p612-b011","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"“$:=$”与“$=$”有什么区别？ 在算法中，$x:=y$ 表示通过把 $y$ 的值赋给变量 $x$ 来更新 $x$。","segments":[{"strong":true,"text":"“"},{"tex":":=","text":":=","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":"”与“"},{"tex":"=","text":"=","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow></math>"},{"strong":true,"text":"”有什么区别？"}," 在算法中，",{"tex":"x:=y","text":"x:=y","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示通过把 ",{"tex":"y","text":"y","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的值赋给变量 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 来更新 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p612-b012"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"与此不同，$x=y$ 是一个命题，陈述 $x$ 等于 $y$。","segments":["与此不同，",{"tex":"x=y","text":"x=y","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>"}," 是一个命题，陈述 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 等于 ",{"tex":"y","text":"y","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p612-b013"},{"pdfPage":612,"page":3,"kind":"paragraph","text":"有关概率分布的更多定义和记号，参见第 23 章和第 29 章。","segments":["有关概率分布的更多定义和记号，参见第 23 章和第 29 章。"],"id":"p612-b014"}]}